    "ruleNumber": "01.03.02",
    "parent": {
      "kind": "core-rule",
      "id": "active-player-and-opposing-player"
    },
    "summary": "When rules of both players can or must be used at the same moment, unless stated otherwise they are resolved in this order, each player ordering their own:\n\n1. the active player’s mandatory rules\n2. the active player’s optional rules they choose to use\n3. the opposing player’s mandatory rules\n4. the opposing player’s optional rules they choose to use\n\nA rule that becomes usable partway through this sequence waits until every other rule of that same timing has been resolved.",
